  "body": "Where else can you find a boutique collection of stylish, freestanding three bedroom residences with northerly water views in great school zones with a garge and extra parking, right here at lot 10 @ 5-7 Calder Place, Glendowie.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed two level, three-bedroom homes with extras everywhere. Garage with internal access, some homes having the option for additional parking, private courtyards, BOSCH appliances, built in fridge/ freezer, built in wardrobe systems, 2.7m studs and multiple bathrooms tiled floor to ceiling with the latest in fixtures and fittings plus a Stamford 10 year guarantee, plus a generous yard that can be fully fenced to keep the pets safe.\r\n\r\nThese are a perfect solution for downsizers wanting to stay in the area, families wanting affordable entry level to the best school zones or investors wanting a quality product.\r\n\r\nThey are just completed, so get in touch to book your viewing – These won’t last long !",
